OL,5,G2255 Scotland Tonight; Weather
OL,6,     FCurrent affairs show tackling the
OL,7,     Fissues behind the headlines from a
OL,8,     FScottish perspective, with studio
OL,9,     Fdebate and analysis of major
OL,10,     Fstories
OL,11,G2325 TikTok: Murder Gone Viral
OL,12,     FA look at the case of American
OL,13,     Finfluencer Alexis Sharkey, who was
OL,14,     Fdeclared missing in November 2020
OL,15,     Fby her husband Thomas Sharkey.
OL,16,     FWhen her body was found on a side
OL,17,     Froad by a truck driver shortly
OL,18,     Fafter, detectives began an
OL,19,     Finvestigation that led to her
OL,20,     Fspouse. However, just two weeks
OL,21,     Fafter the body was found, he also
OL,22,     Fdisappeared without trace
